OL,3,GNEWSANorthern lights paint Midlands
OL,4,Askies colourful hues
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkies across the West Midlands were
OL,7,Faglow with stunning shades of purple,
OL,8,Fpink, blue and green due to a rare
OL,9,Fdisplay of the Northern Lights on
OL,10,FSaturday night.
OL,12,FWhile the natural phenomenon, known as
OL,13,Fthe Aurora Borealis, is typically
OL,14,Fassociated with locations much further
OL,15,Fnorth, strong solar activity meant it
OL,16,Fwas visible in parts of the UK where
OL,17,Fsightings are far less common.
OL,19,FThe Met Office has said sightings could
OL,20,Fcontinue to be possible during clear
OL,21,Fskies until Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
