OL,3,GNEWSANorthern lights paint Midlands
OL,4,Askies colourful hues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spectacular views prompted
OL,7,Fresidents across Wolverhampton,
OL,8,FStaffordshire, Shropshire,
OL,9,FHerefordshire and Nuneaton to send in
OL,10,Ftheir photographs to the BBC.
